---- MODULE LevelBinders ----
THEOREM ASSUME NEW STATE P PROVE P = P OBVIOUS
THEOREM ASSUME NEW ACTION A PROVE A = A OBVIOUS
THEOREM ASSUME NEW TEMPORAL P PROVE P => P OBVIOUS
THEOREM ASSUME NEW STATE F(_), NEW STATE x PROVE F(x) = F(x) OBVIOUS
THEOREM ASSUME NEW VARIABLE x PROVE x' = x' OBVIOUS
THEOREM ASSUME NEW STATE F(_), NEW VARIABLE x PROVE F(x) = F(x) OBVIOUS
====
